&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BEAR REPORT - THE YEAR OF 1847&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Eventful year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;turmoil has been challenging&lt;/p&gt;
