&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width: 100%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Human-cognito memetic scan of now-neutralized anomaly &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3125&quot;&gt;SCP-████&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
