&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-285874-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. For further information, refer to PSYCHE Arm-2372-Pipeline dossier.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-285874-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. In retrieved correspondences from &amp;quot;Jude Kriyot&amp;quot;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-285874-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. A full list available from the PTOLEMY Division upon request.&lt;/div&gt;
