p;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316476" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" >DrChandra</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316476" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Derivative of:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/zhange-artwork">☆ SCP Foundation and the Groups of Interest (11th) ☆</a><br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Cropped.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> ADAM.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Cyberpunk administrator awaits transmission. Source capture and treatment by Ravenelle.<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> ▓▒░ TORLEY ░▒▓ and Ravenelle<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/torley/8485063847">https://www.flickr.com/photos/torley/8485063847</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> rook4.png<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2800867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316476" alt="NatVoltaic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2800867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" >NatVoltaic</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/parawatch-hub">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/parawatch-hub</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> quinnmacallister.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> DSCF0285<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> David Sorich<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/dsorich/15995177749/">https://www.flickr.com/photos/dsorich/15995177749/</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> tonyachappell.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Howdy, Neighbour!<br /> <strong>Authors:</strong> Dennis van Zuijlekom and Vera Wilde<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/dvanzuijlekom/19576879643/">https://www.flickr.com/photos/dvanzuijlekom/19576879643/</a><br /> <strong>Additional notes:</strong> Greyscaled</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> tannerbanner<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> tannerbanner<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3208919&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316476" alt="taylor_itkin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3208919)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" >taylor_itkin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316476" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-wondertainment-hub">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-wondertainment-hub</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nykacolaquantum" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5187906&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316476" alt="Nykacolaquantum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5187906)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nykacolaquantum" >Nykacolaquantum</a></span></p> 
