&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-332075-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Currently Series VI, unless an article was deleted in one of the previous Series.&lt;/div&gt;
